{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act21side_level_act21side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act21side",
  "stageId": "act21side_07",
  "title": "What to be Forgotten",
  "storyCode": "IS-7",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ce0f7a0ab2521ee0489be59cb8ef1cae5fe1d6d412ce95fc3fd47d7d1f1223da",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "The most unremarkable Dipartimento di Sicurezza Alimentare...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "And its popular but underappreciated segretario.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "At this point, men like Carracci, who were propped up to maintain balance between the major famiglie, are no longer needed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "What you need is a puppet that is safe and useful.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "Am I wrong?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "Signor Segretario, a truly safe and useful puppet would never refer to himself as such.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "I just happen to be a bit more self-aware than others.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "Haha. And mightily self-aware you are.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "You're right, Rubio. You <i>are</i> the best candidate to replace Carracci.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "But, if you're willing to be so frank with me, I might as well share something with you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "I'm listening.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "My associates killed Carracci.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "You've got guts, and I like talking with men like you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "So I'm willing to give you a chance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "Turn around and leave this room, forget what you just said, and no harm will come to you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "Then, go back home and spend some time with your wife and daughter. Savor the last moments of peace in this city.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "Doesn't that mean you'd need a puppet like me all the more?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "Hm?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "You're after this chaos. What's happening all around us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "You want to overturn the law laid down by Signora Sicilia. But you don't care if she rules, or if we go back to the old ways.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "The conflict among famiglie never had anything to do with us commoners.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "When something happens, we just wait to see the result.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "It makes no difference to the commoners whether Signora Sicilia rules, or you do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "But, the winner will need someone to maintain the facade of order.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "As the don of a famiglia, surely you understand this principle—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "It isn't impossible for the commoners to survive without the famiglie, but the same cannot be said for the famiglie without the commoners.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "You're telling me that you hold the real power?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "No. I'm making a self-serving justification for the weak.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "A good justification at that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "But it doesn't tell me what you're really after.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "Power, Don Bernardo.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "Since I was a kid, everyone's looked down on me, because I'm weak. And I look like, you know, this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "The oppression I felt from the people around me was more real than anything the famiglie ever did.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "I've suffered that my entire life, waiting for this chance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "You tell me you're one who had Carracci killed? All I can think is: thank goodness I came at the right time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "You may not want to hear this, but if you're going up against Signora Sicilia, it's probably not going to go your way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "But who cares? Doesn't matter to me if you win or lose, in the end—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "But power is something Signora Sicilia can't give me. It's gotta be you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "You're an honest man, Rubio. I like making friends with honest men.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "Hm?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bellone Mafioso",
      "text": "Don Bernardo... (*whispers*)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "Give my order. Tell them, that's enough for today.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bellone Mafioso",
      "text": "Of course.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "What just happened?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "That room over there... started shaking?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "text": "Looks like she chose you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "text": "That earthquake is Giovanna's Arts.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "text": "Sounds like they had a falling out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Look, Texas jumped out the window. Let's go after her!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Right!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "text": "Ahh, Texas. If, and I mean if, we were friends back then... could I have kept you in Siracusa?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "text": "Hah, fat chance, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "text": "We would've just slaughtered each other.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "text": "Lavinia, don't make me... kill you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "text": "I've got a job to do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "text": "Signorina Lavinia, I pray that you aren't born in Siracusa the next time around.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "Just a second.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "text": "Who are you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "You're one of Saluzzo's hitmen, right? This operation... is over.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "Don Bernardo's orders, just in.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "Lavinia, you shouldn't have shown your face here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "text": "That's not up to you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "You've interfered with a Saluzzo operation. That's going to ruin the relationship between our two famiglie.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "text": "Haha...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "text": "So, why don't you go beg Alberto's forgiveness with my head on a silver platter?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "Wait, please. Signor Bernardo... I mean, Don...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "I have a presumptuous request.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "Hm?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "I imagine Signor Leontuzzo will be very busy in the future. It'll unrealistic to expect him to help me the way he did Carracci.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "I'd like to ask you for a new assistant.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "The judge here would be a suitable pick.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "That certainly is one option.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "text": "What are you two talking about?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "Ah, how impertinent of me, carrying on this conversation without including the subject, Signorina Lavinia.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "Don Bernardo has decided that I, Rubio, the humble ex-Segretario di Sicurezza Alimentare, shall take Carracci's place as the next Ministro dei Lavori Pubblici.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "And I have to admit, I'm not too experienced with bureaucratic affairs.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "text": "So I hope that you, as someone with ample experience, will become my assistant.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "(I wonder how Sora and the others are doing...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "What? Why... are you here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "When you get old, you start looking for a place to enjoy the rest of your days.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "text": "Found her! She's right over there!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "text": "Surround her!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Looks like you insist on getting in my way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "She's still worried about you, after what happened.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "As for me, I'm old now, so I spend my days taking care of the youth. It's a hobby.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Stay a while and have a chat with your elder.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Next time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Croissant?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Ohoh, let's have a look-see, who's off fighting all by herself?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Why are you all here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "As far as I can tell, the Siracusan families always fight together. It's your culture.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "And Penguin Logistics's culture iiiis—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "To party hard?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "In this case, it should be—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Don't be afraid to rumble, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "You got it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Seriously though, old man. You think you could let this one slide, a favor from one Sankta to another?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Get'cher head on straight, Exusiai.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "You do have a point.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Ahh, the rainy season in Siracusa is a long one. It didn't bother me when I was young, but now, the arthritis is such a hassle.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Children, striving for strength is fine, but remember to put your health and safety first.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Eh, yer pullin' my leg.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Thanks a bunch!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "By the way, if I ever did want to talk with you, how could I find you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "If you're searching for redemption, I'm afraid there's nothing I can do for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "But if you're searching for order, you will find me everywhere.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "That's enough. Let's get out of here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Woohoo!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "text": "Donna.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "text": "What's the situation?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "text": "The Bellones have retreated.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "text": "Good work.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "text": "Where's Cellinia?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "text": "Gone.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "text": "Gone?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "text": "She couldn't kill me, and I couldn't kill her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "text": "Let's head back and prepare. The Bellones aren't going to let this go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "text": "Right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "text": "You've won, Leontuzzo.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "text": "Your original plan wasn't to win over Wallach, was it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "text": "But wasn't that the best option, given the circumstances?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "text": "Can't deny that. *cough* *cough*",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "text": "Alright, enough talk. Let's get you in the car.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "text": "Leon, you still haven't given up, have you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "text": "Compared to what Lavinia has been through, this setback is nothing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "text": "You're going to do great things.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "text": "Maybe one day, you might actually be able to realize your dreams in Siracusa.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "text": "And when that time comes, you'll be my right-hand man.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "text": "I don't get along with Lavinia.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "text": "There are some things better left to her, and others better left for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "text": "Haha, you cheeky bastard. You're already thinking about that kind of stuff?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "text": "Demetri... I'm still angry about what you and my father were plotting.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "text": "I don't understand why he insists on continuing, even now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "text": "But, in the end, I'm still a part of this famiglia.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Safe landing!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "*gasp*... *gasp*... It feels great to be back on our own turf.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Phew... Siracusans sure are a pain in the ass. I'm totally wiped.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "You hanging in there, Sora?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Yes. But my dress got a little torn up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Well, shoot. That one was awfully expensive, wasn't it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Ahaha, we'll figure something out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Alrighty, one bottle per person.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "C'mon, knock it off with that stone face.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Just think of it this way: the three of us also happened to be on vacation here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Then... what's with the show?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Oh... That's, umm... just a way to grow my career~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Plus, I thought it might make finding you a little easier.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "I reckon it sure did, lookin' at the way things turned out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Sure enough.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The atmosphere remains chilly for a while.\nBut finally, an unavoidable problem emerges.\nWhere do they go from here?\nTexas does not have it in her to ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Tex...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Texas, I had an agreement with the director.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Hm?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Now that I've found you, I will stay here and complete my performance contract.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "But—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "I've spoken with the director a few times. It's a little scary, in retrospect, but I don't think he's the kind of man to hold our lives over you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "You have a point. If he wanted to do something like that, he would've locked us up a long time ago.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Okay, alright, let's quit the jawin'. You keep talkin' and I keep gettin' scareder n' scareder.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "We really are here to see you. If it wasn't so dangerous out there, I'd like you to show us around.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Okay... When we're through all this, I'll give you a tour.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Anyways, let's celebrate this Penguin Logistics reunion in Siracusa!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "All Four",
      "text": "Cheers!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "The biggest thing—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Hm?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "An unknown number...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "I don't remember ever giving out this number...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Hello? Who am I speaking with...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "It seems you're safe and sound, Signorina Sora. That's a relief.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "You know what happened with Texas, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "Don't worry, Signorina.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "Your Penguin Logistics friends must be enjoying a joyous reunion.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "And I certainly don't want to interrupt that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "But I was just thinking you might have a lot of questions for me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "text": "So, I'll be waiting for you at the theater tomorrow.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
